Package: Triage
Type: Package
Title: LLM-Adjudicated Cell-Type Annotation with Cell Ontology Grounding
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Triage", family = "contributors", role = "aut",
        comment = "See git history for individual contributors"),
    person(given = "shaolab-UM", email = "linfanxiao.bio@gmail.com",
        role = "cre", comment = "Repository contact"))
Maintainer: shaolab-UM <linfanxiao.bio@gmail.com>
Description: Triage adjudicates single-cluster cell-type annotations from
    multiple reviewers (CASSIA, an in-house marker-based annotator and
    enrichment-based annotation) into a single Cell Ontology grounded final
    decision, and provides CL-Linker, a deterministic lexical Cell Ontology
    label mapper. The deterministic adjudication core (normalization,
    release policy, consensus rules and the local validation gate) runs
    fully offline; Handling Editor / Chief QC adjudication can optionally be
    executed through a DeepSeek-compatible LLM API.
